title: All Things
description: Every site and project of Jamie Thingelstad’s that is live today, in one list, each a link straight to it.
---
{#- All Things: the list the sites strip's last link opens on every one of Jamie's sites (thingelstad.com AGENTS.md,
    "The sites strip"). It is model.live: every active thing with a website of its own, by collection, each name a
    link straight to that site (with ?ref=xyz-all where Tinylytics counts it) under the name its site goes by, its
    tagline under it. The strip's own sites come first, in the strip's order. Dense on purpose, a page of links in
    columns (Jamie, 2026-11-10: "think Craigslist"), each with one short line. It writes itself from the
    records, so a new live thing appears with no change to the strip. A jump list, not a record: no microformats,
    and the record pages stay the h-entries. #}
{%- set count = 0 %}{% for group in site.live %}{% set count = count + group.things | length %}{% endfor %}
<h1 class="all-title">All Things</h1>
<p class="all-note muted">Every one of Jamie’s things with a site of its own that is running today, {{ count }} of them. The rest are on <a href="/things/">Things</a>.</p>
<div class="all-columns">
  {% for group in site.live %}
  <section class="all-group" id="{{ group.name | slugify }}">
    <h2><a href="/things/?collection={{ group.slug }}">{{ group.name }}</a></h2>
    <ul>
      {% for item in group.things %}
      <li><a href="{{ item.href }}">{{ item.name }}</a><span class="all-tagline">{{ item.tagline }}</span></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
